Derived portions used in this project:

  - src/com/zaka/douyin/glass/GlassShader.java
      Rounded-rect SDF refraction shader, refraction-with-dispersion shader,
      and the 45-degree directional highlight shader, ported from the AGSL
      shader sources of AndroidLiquidGlass (internal/Shaders.kt).

  - src/com/zaka/douyin/glass/GlassPainter.java
      Effect ordering and parameters (vibrancy -> blur -> lens -> highlight ->
      surface tint -> inner shadow) follow AndroidLiquidGlass
      (effects/Lens.kt, effects/Blur.kt, effects/ColorFilter.kt,
      highlight/HighlightStyle.kt).

  - src/com/zaka/douyin/glass/DockOverlay.java
      Draggable dock indicator (follow the finger, resistance past the ends,
      spring release to the nearest slot, dispersion while dragging) is modeled
      after AndroidLiquidGlass (LiquidBottomTabs.kt, DampedDragAnimation,
      InteractiveHighlight).

  - src/com/zaka/douyin/glass/Spring.java
      Single-value damped spring, same integration scheme as
      AndroidLiquidGlass (internal/util/Animatable.kt).

